238
00:19:44.686 --> 00:19:48.221
[woman 1] This girl has brought
the devil to our home.

239
00:19:49.222 --> 00:19:51.726
-[bell ringing]
-[crowd wailing]

240
00:19:53.427 --> 00:19:55.963
