1247
01:45:41.408 --> 01:45:42.543
[man 19] Let's move.

1248
01:45:42.710 --> 01:45:44.946
[battle drum music playing]

1249
01:45:45.913 --> 01:45:47.548
[men screaming]

1250
01:45:57.758 --> 01:46:00.094
