1318
01:53:08.789 --> 01:53:09.990
[thud]

1319
01:53:13.794 --> 01:53:16.096
[soft music playing]

1320
01:53:17.331 --> 01:53:19.500
[tribal chanting]

1321
01:53:36.884 --> 01:53:39.453
[crowd cheering]

1322
01:53:43.758 --> 01:53:45.225
[horse grunts]

1323
01:53:50.264 --> 01:53:53.467
